\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Norway \highlight\uc2  C.Bank says  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  not suitable tool. \b0\par\par\uc2 176 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Juni 1998\par 14:02\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  OSLO, June 17 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Norway\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Norges Bank, said on Wednesday \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a large scale on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets was not a suitable to maintain a stable exchange rate for the crown. \par \par \uc2  The bank said it would inform markets if it decided to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on any large scale again, a practice that it has not used since January 1997. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a large scale is not a suitable tool," Jan Qvigstad, a director at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , told a news conference. \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  can help flatten out (changes) in a single day when the market is thin," he said. \par \par \uc2  The crown, which has been depressed recently due to tumbling oil prices, government wrangling with opposition parties over the revised 1998 budget and high wage settlements, firmed slightly on Wednesday against the mark to 4.2345 compared with 4.2455 late on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  ((Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41, fax +47 22 42 00 18, oslo.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010925du6h02pp9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
