\par\par \b \uc2  Europe Focus: Norway Krone Gains Don't Kill Rate-Rise Fears \b0\par\par\uc2  By Fredrik Tangeraas \par \uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 1998\par 16:07\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  OSLO (Dow Jones)--The Norwegian krone (NOK) gained some ground against the Deutsche mark Thursday, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's advance wasn't enough to dispel market expectations of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate rise in the near term. \par \par \uc2  "The krone can't shake off the pressure that easily," said a dealer with one of Norway's biggest banks. \par \par \uc2  He said he expects the krone to be hurt by fears that spring wage negotiations among employers and unions will result in a generous wage settlement, which could drive up prices. He also noted concerns that the government's 1998 budget was too expansionary to cool down the booming economy. \par \par \uc2  Such concerns already have pushed the krone to around its lowest level since October 1996. And a weak krone boosts market expectations of an interest rate increase from Norges Bank, the Norwegian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , since the bank's only monetary policy mandate is to keep the krone stable versus European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In late trade Thursday the Deutsche mark fetched NOK4.2355, down from NOK4.2510 late in the previous session, and market sources noted that Norges Bank, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Norway\b0 \highlight\uc2 , hadn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Peter Warren, chief dealer at Finansbanken in Oslo. attributed the krone's gains to a correction following a steep drop a day earlier, saying the mark had been overbought. \par \par \uc2  "There was krone buying from both domestic and foreign investors" Thursday, he said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 28-05-98 \par \par \uc2  1407GMT \par \par \uc2  1089 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du5s04kxh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
