\par\par \b \uc2  Nordic  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 : Norway, Sweden Kr Sinks Vs DM On Foreign Sales \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 September 1997\par 13:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  OSLO (AP-Dow Jones)--Both the Norwegian and Swedish \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are down against the Deutsche mark around midday Friday, compared with their levels earlier in the day, on foreign selling. \par \par \uc2  'We've been suffering from 'Scandi-mania' over past week,' said one trader said, citing heavy speculative buying of both the Norwegian and Swedish units from U.S. investment banks. 'However, foreign flows are now moving out, and it's a healthy correction.' the same trader added. \par \par \uc2  At 1145 GMT, the Deutsche mark was at 4.0770 Norwegian kroner, markedly up from 4.0625 kroner at the start of European trade, and even stronger than its quote 4.0465 kroner in Asian trade. \par \par \uc2  But volatility continues to be a dominant feature for the Norwegian unit, owing to Norway's indecisive parliamentary elections at the start of this week, traders said. \par \par \uc2  And if the Norwegian unit continues to exhibit big swings, traders argued the Norges Bank, \b \highlight22\uc2 Norway\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , may \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's fluctuations. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the Swedish krona is also losing ground against the mark. \par \par \uc2  At 1145 GMT, the Deutsche mark fetched 4.2845 kroner, up from 4.2715 at the start of the day, but down a touch down from 4.2910 kronor late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Sweden's 1998 budget bill figures released early Friday failed to stir up much excitement in the market, as most of its contents had been leaked to the local press overnight, according to traders. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 19-09-97 \par \par \uc2  1157GMT \par \par \uc2  1058 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt9j070k0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
