\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Norway Central Bank \highlight\uc2  says curbing  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2 200 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Januar 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  OSLO, Jan 10 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Norway\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday it would not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for some time to try and dampen a strongly appreciating crown. \par \par \uc2  In a statement announcing a second interest rate cut in two days, the bank said it would now significantly reduce its \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  "...in the light of developments in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, Norges Bank will not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to any substantial extent in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market over a period," the bank said. \par \par \uc2  The bank said it had reduced its overnight deposit and overnight lending rate by 25 basis points to 3.25 percent and 5.25 percent respectively. \par \par \uc2  On Thursday the bank cut rates by 50 basis points. \par \par \uc2  "Since the reduction in interest rates on January 8, the crown has continued to appreciate against European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Norges Bank has had to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily in the market with a view to stabilising the exchange rate," the statement said. \par \par \uc2  The bank said it had bought foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  equivalent to 20 billion crowns since the start of 1997. \par \par \uc2  --Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1997 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011002dt1a07w38\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
