hlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut key official interest rates to cool the krone's strengthening streak. The 0.50 percentage point rate easing brought the deposit rate down to 4.00% and the overnight lending rate to 6%. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 03-12-96 \par \par \uc2  1105GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsc301eq8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
