\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Norway \highlight\uc2 's NOK Softens Slightly On  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Speculation \b0\par\par\uc2 279 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 September 1995\par 14:34\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  OSLO (AP-DJ)--The Norwegian krone (NOK) is marginally weaker in quiet trade mid-session Friday, according to local dealers. \par \par \uc2  They say the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has softened slightly against a basket of European crosses because of market expectations about \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has played its cards very wisely,' said a dealer with Citibank \b \highlight22\uc2 Norway\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Oslo. 'It's achieved the objective of an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  without actually carrying out the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , merely by playing on market psychology.' \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  frequently with small amounts last week, local dealers say. Unlike most of its European counterparts, the Norwegian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is relatively active in the market, often carrying out small-scale inventions to smooth out the edges. \par \par \uc2  But this week, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  hasn't been seen in the market. Many investors who'd prepared for another round of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  by buying up kroner last week have been forced to sell again this week, thereby weakening the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers say. \par \par \uc2  Measured on the theoretical weighted ECU index, which moves inversely to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength, the krone is at 103.21 points mid-session Friday, compared with 103.18 points late afternoon a day earlier. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the Deutsche mark is trading at 4.3585 kroner, down from 4.3634 kroner late afternoon Thursday. The mark has weakened broadly because of the dollar's continued rally against the yen, which spilled over to Europe Friday morning, dealers say. \par \par \uc2  In the money market, the three-month Norwegian interbank lending rate (NIBOR) tightened Friday to 5.26% from 5.23% a day earlier. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-09-95 \par \par \uc2  1234GMT \par \par \uc2  1162 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr9f075qb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
