\par\par \b \uc2  Norway's NOK Strengthens With DEM; Traders See Trend \b0\par\par\uc2 299 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1995\par 14:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  OSLO (AP-DJ)--The Norwegian krone is strengthening along with the Deutsche mark Thursday, dealers say. As the krone gains against other European crosses, it remains stable against the German \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  In mid-afternoon trade in the spot market, the mark trades at 4.4178 kroner, little changed from 4.4162 kroner the day before. \par \par \uc2  Measured on the theoretical ECU index, which moves inversely to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength, the krone is slightly firmer at 103.52 pointsin mid-afternoon trading Thursday, compared with 103.65 points late afternoon Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Although the mark is a heavy component of the weighted index, dealers say the krone's strengthening against other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  is substantial enough to yield a total gain of 0.1% on the index since late afternoon Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they had seen no trace of Norges Bank, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in the market Thursday, despite the krone's strengthening streak. Although the krone is officially floating, \b \highlight22\uc2 Norway\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  frequently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market with small amounts to keep the krone stable. \par \par \uc2  'The krone's strengthening this week merely confirms a trend we've noticed ever since the referendum on European Union membership on Nov. 28 of last year,' said a dealer with Fokus Bank A.S. in Norway. 'Some foreign traders, particularly from London, are fleeing to the krone when the market's in turmoil. There's no doubt in my mind the krone is one of the strongest \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Europe now, and that it's quickly building a reputation as a safehaven.' \par \par \uc2  In the money market, meanwhile, the three-month interbank lending rate eased marginally Thursday to 5.32%, from 5.33% the day before. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 02-03-95 \par \par \uc2  1313GMT \par \par \uc2  1162 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr3201him\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
