\par\par \b \uc2  Norway's NOK Weaker Against Most European Crosses \b0\par\par\uc2 235 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Februar 1995\par 13:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  OSLO (AP-DJ)--Norway's krone is slightly weaker against most European crosses, notably the Deutsche mark, in early-afternoon trade Monday. \par \par \uc2  In line with the pan-European trend, the krone is weakening against the mark as market players rally to the perceived safe haven of the German \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In the spot market the mark traded at 4.3974 kroner at 1210 GMT Monday, up from 4.3875 kroner late afternoon Friday. \par \par \uc2  Measured on the unofficial ECU index, which moves inverse to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength, the krone is weaker at 103.74 points early afternoon Monday, from 103.66 points late afternoon Friday. \par \par \uc2  Last week, the krone strengthened against most other European crosses because of news that government revenues would increase dramatically on the back of higher-than-projected oil production. \par \par \uc2  Dealers say Norges Bank, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  late last week to weaken the krone. In \b \highlight22\uc2 Norway\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  frequently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  with small amounts to prevent the krone from strengthening or weakening too sharply, although the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is officialy floating. \par \par \uc2  'I believe the krone will remain strong,' said a dealer with Finansbanken a.s. 'The fact that the krone strengthened substantially (last week) while the pound and the Swedish krona softened, is an indication of the market's long-term confidence in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-02-95 \par \par \uc2  1251GMT \par \par \uc2  1162 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr2k01461\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
