\par\par \b \uc2  Norway's NOK Strengthens On Higher Oil Revenues \b0\par\par\uc2 249 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Februar 1995\par 14:22\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  OSLO (AP-DJ)--Norway's krone is strengthening Thursday against most European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  following Wednesday's news that the government will see its revenues increase dramatically because of higher oil production. \par \par \uc2  Measured on the unofficial ECU index, which moves inversely to the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength, the krone is at 103.66 points in mid-afternoon trade, down from 103.84 points late afternoon Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  In line with most European \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  though, the krone is weaker against the Deutsche mark, although dealers point out the krone is softening much less than other crosses. At 1235 GMT the mark trades at 4.3850 kroner, up from 4.3765 kroner late afternoon Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  'This is most likely a permanent strengthening of the krone based on Norway's solid economic fundamentals,' said one dealer with Den norske Bank (DnB) in Bergen. 'Month after month the krone's been supported by positive current account data. Now, with the unexpectedly high oil revenues coming in on top of that, the krone's firming Thursday is a reflection of long-term confidence in the economy.' \par \par \uc2  He said the krone is now at its strongest level on the ECU index since the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was allowed to float in 1992. He said he did not know whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the krone. \b \highlight22\uc2 Norway\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  frequently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  with small amounts to keep the krone stable. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 16-02-95 \par \par \uc2  1322GMT \par \par \uc2  1162 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr2g011yk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
